  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 Chef and owner Freja Lindqvist Freja grew up salting fish on Fan\u00f8 and cooked in Paris and Lofoten before coming home to open Gl\u00f8d in 2019. About Freja About Freja Instagram Instagram About Freja Freja grew up on Fan\u00f8, salting fish with her grandmother. She cooked in Paris for three years, then in Lofoten, where she learned to cook with nothing but wood, salt and patience. She came home in 2018 with a notebook of recipes and no restaurant, and cooked pop-up dinners in a friend\u2019s bakery on J\u00e6gersborggade on a grill built from an old oil drum. When the bakery moved, she took the lease and built the hearth where the ovens used to be. In the kitchen Freja lights the fire at noon and cooks every service. She writes the menu most mornings after the deliveries arrive, and still does the Tuesday market run herself. Chef and owner at Gl\u00f8d. Book a table The rest of us One team, one",
